     m_sTitle "I. Situation:"
     m_sContent "Time & Weather:"\
     "Time: 04:52"\
     "Cloudy"\
     ""\
     "Situation:"\
     "East German Army is sending a Rifle Company (-) with 2x BMP-1s support to clear out the town of Kaaranmanniko after defeating a US Rifle Company. "\
     ""\
     "Survivors from 2nd US PLT from the earlier engagement are conducting a hasty defence of Kaaranmannikko after managing to destroy 3x T-72s on the road with their HMMWV TOW."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D6A5E38C79E8B5A9}" {
     m_iOrder 1
