     "Continue to fortify, utilizing the forests area & buildings to deny our usage of the vehicles."\
     ""\
     "MDCOA:"\
     "Funnel our infantry into kill zones and evading our attempt to pin and destroy them."\
     ""\
     "CBRN Threat:"\
